<h1>AcademicAI — Practical Faculty Demonstration Guide</h1>

<div class="banner">
  <strong>Project:</strong> AcademicAI — NLP-Based Academic Intelligence and Personalized Student Assistance Platform<br>
  <strong>Target Course:</strong> CSI4001 — Natural Language Processing and Computational Linguistics (EPJ)<br>
  <strong>Evaluator:</strong> Prof. Vijayarajan V, School of Computer Science and Engineering, VIT<br>
  <strong>Anchor Date:</strong> October 31, 2026 &bull; <strong>System Status:</strong> 100% Operational (11/11 automated suites passing)
</div>

